1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,206
Space and Planets with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,506 --> 00:00:12,914
Mimo: Hi friends! Today we're flying our rocket into outer space to learn about the sun, the moon, the stars and the planets!

3
00:00:13,214 --> 00:00:14,913
Bruno: Do they have snacks in space?

4
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:20,202
Mimo: Let's find out! Everybody in!

5
00:00:23,459 --> 00:00:26,967
Mimo: Count down with us! Three, two, one...

6
00:00:28,467 --> 00:00:29,804
Mimo: Blast off!

7
00:00:32,304 --> 00:00:36,388
Mimo: Wow! We're in outer space! Look at all the stars!

8
00:00:38,088 --> 00:00:45,166
Mimo: This is the sun! The sun is a big, hot star. It gives us light and keeps us warm.

9
00:00:45,466 --> 00:00:46,798
Mimo: Can you say sun?

10
00:00:48,698 --> 00:00:51,046
Bruno: Phew! It's hot! Let's not get too close!

11
00:00:52,746 --> 00:00:59,898
Mimo: This is the moon! We can see the moon at night. It's bumpy and has lots of holes called craters.

12
00:01:00,198 --> 00:01:01,597
Mimo: Can you say moon?

13
00:01:03,497 --> 00:01:07,100
Bruno: Let's jump on the moon! On the moon, you can jump super high!

14
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,324
Bruno: Wheee! I'm a flying bear!

15
00:01:14,824 --> 00:01:22,010
Mimo: These are stars! Stars twinkle, twinkle in the night sky. There are more stars than we can count!

16
00:01:22,310 --> 00:01:23,995
Mimo: Can you say stars?

17
00:01:27,295 --> 00:01:32,971
Mimo: This planet is very special. It's planet Earth! That's where we live!

18
00:01:33,271 --> 00:01:38,473
Mimo: Earth is blue and green, with water and land. Can you say Earth?

19
00:01:40,373 --> 00:01:44,300
Bruno: Hi, Earth! Hi, Pip! Hi, Lulu! We can see your house!

20
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,685
Mimo: This is Mars! Mars is called the red planet, because it's red and dusty.

21
00:01:51,985 --> 00:01:53,626
Mimo: Can you say Mars?

22
00:01:57,526 --> 00:01:59,572
Bruno: Red? Is it made of strawberry jam?

23
00:01:59,872 --> 00:02:03,909
Mimo: No, Bruno! It's made of red rocks and dust!

24
00:02:05,609 --> 00:02:10,692
Mimo: And this is Saturn! Saturn has big, beautiful rings all around it.

25
00:02:10,992 --> 00:02:12,541
Mimo: Can you say Saturn?

26
00:02:14,441 --> 00:02:17,118
Bruno: It looks like a giant donut! I'm getting hungry.

27
00:02:19,418 --> 00:02:23,183
Mimo: Let's say everything we saw in space! Ready?

28
00:02:23,483 --> 00:02:24,430
Mimo: Sun!

29
00:02:25,230 --> 00:02:25,604
Bruno: Moon!

30
00:02:26,404 --> 00:02:27,497
Mimo: Stars!

31
00:02:28,297 --> 00:02:28,648
Bruno: Earth!

32
00:02:29,448 --> 00:02:30,469
Mimo: Mars!

33
00:02:31,269 --> 00:02:33,060
Bruno: Saturn, the donut planet!

34
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:39,902
Mimo: Great job, space explorers! Now let's fly home to planet Earth!

35
00:02:40,202 --> 00:02:41,505
Bruno: Home for snacks!

36
00:02:41,805 --> 00:02:45,260
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! See you next time!
